WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:01.700
- Find your center of balance, bro.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.533
- [Toy] Ready!

00:00:02.533 --> 00:00:05.519
- Hey, guy, you asked me
who I made on Overwatch.

00:00:05.519 --> 00:00:06.352
(toy screaming)

00:00:06.352 --> 00:00:07.750
I'm not gonna give you
(laughs), not gonna tell you.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:09.300
I'm gonna make you wait for the footage.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.133
- [Toy] We don't have all day!

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:11.490
I'm flying!
(toy crashing)

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.460
You won't get rid of me that easily!

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:16.377
(electronic music)

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:20.760
- Now you guys know my username.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:23.430
As you can tell, I am currently plat

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:25.250
which is upsetting to me.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.235
Okay.

00:00:26.235 --> 00:00:27.068
- [Player] Oh, shit.

00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:28.040
- Aggressive, I like it, Rein, I like it.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:30.220
I'm not even against it,
I'm not even mad at that.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:32.390
I'm healing you up, keep
swinging like a champ, baby.

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:34.220
Diva, you're low health,
Diva, you're low health.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:35.380
Diva, you're low health!

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:36.750
Wait, Winston, wait wait wait,

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.060
I gotta heal you up, buddy, let's go.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:40.814
Let's go, let's go, easy work, baby!

00:00:40.814 --> 00:00:43.950
(weapons firing)
(characters grunting)

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:44.783
I got a pick.

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:47.269
Two picks.

00:00:47.269 --> 00:00:49.070
- (Player] What, who's doing this?

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:50.470
Is it the real one or?

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:51.920
- I'm the real Doctor Mike, brother.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:53.120
Long time, no see, Black Dog.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:54.606
Did you learn left from right?

00:00:54.606 --> 00:00:55.564
- [Player] (bleep) you!

00:00:55.564 --> 00:00:56.586
(Mike and Black Dog laughing)

00:00:56.586 --> 00:00:57.490
- You were messing with
our minds, I get it.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:58.920
- [Player] No, their minds, right?

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:01.160
- They can't hear our chat,
bro, this isn't Call of Duty.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.627
Where is this Widow?

00:01:02.627 --> 00:01:05.690
(weapons firing)

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:07.570
- [Player] She's on the left.

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:09.470
- I got her, I got her, good call-out.

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:12.320
All right, Soldier's down.

00:01:13.679 --> 00:01:15.540
(weapons firing)

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:17.165
Widow's down.

00:01:17.165 --> 00:01:20.370
(weapons firing)

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:21.280
Zen's down.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:22.620
Road Hog is the only one.

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:24.960
Use him for all charge
and keep pushing point.

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.530
Get three on point, get three on point.

00:01:26.530 --> 00:01:28.080
All day, all day, every day.

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:29.270
You gotta love Overwatch!

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:31.660
I mean, it's frustrating
when you have a team member

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:32.610
that won't swap.

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:34.630
You're begging them to go Healer

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:36.840
or Tank or Shield Tank, whatever it is.

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:39.150
But if you get a team that's in sync,

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:41.440
even if you lose, I think
it's still fun to play.

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:43.230
Just 'cause there's so much teamwork,

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:44.950
deciding what Ults go first.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.288
- [Player] Did you lose your Ult?

00:01:46.288 --> 00:01:49.238
- No!
(weapons firing)

00:01:49.238 --> 00:01:52.900
No, what a nupe!
(weapons firing)

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:53.810
I saved you!

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:55.510
I saved you, Black Dog!

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:57.110
- [Player] Thanks, but uh, yeah.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.670
- Oh yeah, let's go!

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:01.550
Hahaha, sorry, Mercy.

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:03.715
Oh, wait, who sniped me?

00:02:03.715 --> 00:02:06.960
(weapons firing)
(grunting)

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.269
Rein down.

00:02:08.269 --> 00:02:11.590
(weapons firing)
(grunting)

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:12.423
RoadHog down.

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:16.470
That's right, baby.

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:18.913
Guys, I'm literally
fighting by myself here.

00:02:20.444 --> 00:02:22.030
(Mike laughing)

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:23.393
- [Player] We're gamers.

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:26.123
- What?

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:31.750
Oh, great first pick, that's huge!

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:34.920
The thing about Overwatch
is that it's simple

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.820
yet incredibly complex.

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:38.320
It almost reminds me of chess,

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:39.610
even though I'm not a big chess player,

00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:41.520
but this season I've been
playing Junkrat a lot

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:42.700
which I know may surprise you.

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:44.320
In real life, I'm
constantly healing people,

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:46.652
so I come home, I wanna do some damage.

00:02:46.652 --> 00:02:48.380
(weapons firing)

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:50.140
That's what I do, baby boo!

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:51.170
That's what I do.

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:53.260
Go left, go left, go left.

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:54.700
Or not, wow, okay.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:56.970
My mic was muted this
whole time, I'm a nupe.

00:02:56.970 --> 00:02:59.810
Yo, Reaper, we really need
you to pick it up, baby!

00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:00.643
Come on!

00:03:00.643 --> 00:03:03.160
Our Reaper went off second tank

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:05.320
and now has been just playing trash bag.

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:07.530
I tried, I tried so hard.

00:03:07.530 --> 00:03:09.750
All right, that was a tough loss.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.010
That's the thing about this game.

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:13.570
Like, I got up to 3,100.

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:14.730
I know it's not amazing,

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:18.910
but, and then like in two
days, I drop like 300 SR.

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:20.850
That's so, this game is stressful.

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:22.210
That's why I said on Surgeon Simulator.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:25.260
This is the most frustrating
thing I've ever played.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.450
And I play Overwatch.

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:28.360
But it's that good kind of stress that,

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:30.220
when you overcome it, you feel good.

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:31.760
Mr. Pancake.

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:33.830
Yo, Mr. Pancake, didn't
I just play with you?

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:34.920
No, okay.

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:36.850
