putting a lot of damage.

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:06.713
Good job, Genji.

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:09.463
(weapons firing)

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:15.220
That's what we do,
baby, that's what we do.

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:17.770
Keep it simple, KIS.

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.420
Someone called me, but
they obviously didn't know

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:20.556
